<p>You've heard me talk about risk matrices for years. Lately I've been writing about decision records too. Most teams I talk to keep both somewhere nobody can find, if they keep them at all.</p>
<p>So I'm building Cascadras. It will be one place for your team's decisions, risk matrix and service tiers, across every repo, backed by git.</p>
<p>It's under development now. I'd like a small group of SAI readers to be the first to try it, and to tell me what to change while it's still easy to change.</p>

